            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n        Ex 35.30—36.1.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " The ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.31.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.31.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " said to Moses, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.31.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.31.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 31:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“See, I have called by name Bezalel the son of Uri, son of Hur, of the tribe of Judah: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.31.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.31.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 31:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "and I have filled him with the Spirit of God, with ability and intelligence, with knowledge and all craftsmanship, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.31.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.31.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 31:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "to devise artistic designs, to work in gold, silver, and bronze, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.31.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.31.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 31:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "in cutting stones for setting, and in carving wood, for work in every craft. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.31.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.31.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 31:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And behold, I have appointed with him Oholiab, the son of Ahisamach, of the tribe of Dan; and I have given to all able men ability, that they may make all that I have commanded you: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.31.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.31.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 31:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "the tent of meeting, and the ark of the testimony, and the mercy seat that is thereon, and all the furnishings of the tent, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.31.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.31.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 31:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "the table and its utensils, and the pure lampstand with all its utensils, and the altar of incense, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.31.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.31.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 31:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "and the altar of burnt offering with all its utensils, and the laver and its base, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.31.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.31.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 31:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "and the finely worked garments, the holy garments for Aaron the priest and the garments of his sons, for their service as priest, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.31.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.31.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 31:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "and the anointing oil and the fragrant incense for the holy place. According to all that I have commanded you they shall do.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.31.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.31.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
